    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρυμν-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, 
			Comp.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος,</span>
		
			Sup.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.138
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Acerat.
		</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
			599
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Jul.
		</span></i>): (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύω Β</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fenced, fortified, strong,</i> by
			art or nature, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γλήχωνά τ᾽ ἐρυμνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.30.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cam.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					68
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖναι μὲν πύργοισι..ἐρυμναί, Δῆλος
					δ᾽ Ἀπόλλωνι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐρυμνά</span>
			<i>strong positions,</i> X <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.</u>
				5.7.31
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι οἱ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1330b18
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					42.15
				</span></i>
			 ; of hills, <i>steep, sheer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὄθρυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.514
				</span></i>
			, etc. Adv.
			
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οτέρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1331a30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
